abstract = {This paper introduces an innovative tool equipped with a multi-perspective, user-friendly dashboard designed to enhance the explainability of AI models, particularly in cybersecurity. By enabling users to select data samples and apply various xAI methods, the tool provides insightful views into the decision-making processes of AI systems. These methods offer diverse perspectives and deepen the understanding of how models derive their conclusions, thus demystifying the "black box" of AI. The tool’s architecture facilitates easy integration with existing ML models, making it accessible to users regardless of their technical expertise. This approach promotes transparency and fosters trust in AI applications by aligning decision-making with domain knowledge and mitigating potential biases.},
